OL,3,GNEWSAMum's fatal BBL an accident - but 
OL,4,Arisk of more deaths                    
OL,6,FA mother-of-five's death has been ruled
OL,7,Fan accident after she suffered fatal   
OL,8,Finjuries from being given seven times  
OL,9,Fthe recommended filler during a        
OL,10,Fcosmetic procedure.                    
OL,12,FAlice Webb, 33, collapsed at a friend's
OL,13,Fhouse in Gloucester on 23 September    
OL,14,F2024 and died the following day after a
OL,15,Fliquid Brazilian butt lift (BBL).      
OL,17,FAt Gloucestershire Coroner's Court     
OL,18,Fearlier, a jury concluded Webb's death 
OL,19,Fwas an accident. But the coroner ruled 
OL,20,Fthere were "significant risks" of      
OL,21,Ffuture deaths and plans to send a      
OL,22,Freport to the government.              
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
